{"2739600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kalpa of Sword", "steam_appid": 2739600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>免费开玩</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/71169b44ce1fff2295296a5218071349.avif?t=1749519796\" width=618 height=637 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“这位兄弟请留步，我看你印堂饱满，紫气逼人，绝非凡胎，要不随我一同修仙....”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >灵州大陆天道崩坏，灵力散落天地，奇魔异兽丛生，修士只有磨砺出至强实力方可自保。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >因而法理尽失，弱肉强食；在野外探险，杀人夺宝，宗门劫掠比比皆是。修仙者肆性而为，或独身或合作或背刺，仙途全由自己选择，如此乱世，后人史称“剑气劫”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/b97eefb41273e97d82f25e106bec4fa7.webp?t=1749519796\" width=618 height=55 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/5b366b5f89a3ead103f06b0b8f405821.poster.avif?t=1749519796\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/5b366b5f89a3ead103f06b0b8f405821.webm?t=1749519796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>游戏内没有繁琐的任务和日常，地图全开放式采集、刷宝；资源的高频刷新，助力道友境界快速提升。道友们还能使用各色坐骑，御空飞行，游历广袤大陆。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/fd48d6dc6abcfdcc95e2fa9ac82f4f03.webp?t=1749519796\" width=618 height=55 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/b11b186675b453abad7b48fd012b4652.poster.avif?t=1749519796\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/b11b186675b453abad7b48fd012b4652.webm?t=1749519796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>奇魔异兽将君临各个不同属性的界域，静候各位道友的挑战。成功将其击杀还会爆出各色稀有武器和装备，更有附着强大技能的专属神器期待有缘人的降临。变强吧，命定之人！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/d61fe96cc7683191396e455c1277863d.webp?t=1749519796\" width=618 height=55 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/6ab8a59c72191d37d6f4a2d3a4ef894f.poster.avif?t=1749519796\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/6ab8a59c72191d37d6f4a2d3a4ef894f.webm?t=1749519796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>注意！野外将对全部道友开放敌对击杀功能，一旦死亡，道友等级积分全部清零；部分地图还附带死亡掉落功能，若身怀重宝请注意及时返回安全区储存或回收，以免被人中途劫道，杀人夺宝。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/5de165be08aeb9108a3ecfdd532a5a14.webp?t=1749519796\" width=618 height=55 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/df82a5228ce6094a754460a7fd1bd1b9.poster.avif?t=1749519796\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/df82a5228ce6094a754460a7fd1bd1b9.webm?t=1749519796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>厌倦了尔虞我诈，道友还可以选择加入宗门，组队结伴修行。有了亲朋助力，无论是协力破魔，还是制霸界域，一切想象皆可成真。不同职业的配合，还能让战斗变得更加丰富刺激。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/813ed5c5ea430570d588226f1763fa35.webp?t=1749519796\" width=618 height=55 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/5f34801157e62dc3d643bc502a8c2b93.poster.avif?t=1749519796\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/5f34801157e62dc3d643bc502a8c2b93.webm?t=1749519796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>地图隐藏的随机事件等待各位道友的探寻。或偶遇先辈机缘，获得令人羡慕的神兵利器；又或雷劫渡体，一朝成就金仙最强之身，游戏里的惊喜无处不在。</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“这位兄弟请留步，我看你印堂饱满，紫气逼人，绝非凡胎，要不随我一同修仙....”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >灵州大陆天道崩坏，灵力散落天地，奇魔异兽丛生，修士只有磨砺出至强实力方可自保。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >因而法理尽失，弱肉强食；在野外探险，杀人夺宝，宗门劫掠比比皆是。修仙者肆性而为，或独身或合作或背刺，仙途全由自己选择，如此乱世，后人史称“剑气劫”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/b97eefb41273e97d82f25e106bec4fa7.webp?t=1749519796\" width=618 height=55 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739600/extras/5b366b5f89a3ead103f06b0b8f405821.poster.avif?t=1749519796\" width=620 height=348 ><source 